OL,3,AManhunt in western Turkey after eight
OL,4,Akilled in series of shootings
OL,5,
OL,6,FA manhunt is under way for a suspect in
OL,7,Fwestern Turkey after eight people were
OL,8,Fkilled and one seriously injured in a
OL,9,Fseries of shootings.
OL,11,FThe attacks took place in the
OL,12,FAfyonkarahisar province on Thursday,
OL,13,Fwith victims found in several locations
OL,14,Fin three separate vehicles, according
OL,15,Fto local reports.
OL,17,FCCTV footage published in Turkish media
OL,18,Fshowed a man in a black jacket, white
OL,19,Ftrousers and glasses clutching a long
OL,20,Fweapon as he stood by a red minivan.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
