OL,3,AManhunt in western Turkey after eight
OL,4,Akilled in series of shootings
OL,5,
OL,6,FTurkey's state-run Anadolu Agency
OL,7,Freported that three people were killed
OL,8,Fnear Ayazini village and three others
OL,9,Fnear Kiyir village. In Yukaritandir,
OL,10,Ftwo women were found injured and later
OL,11,Fdied in hospital.
